1
00:00:20,820 --> 00:00:24,000
又没有邮件
No mail. Again.

2
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:26,860
嘿 传送门 联系爸爸
Hey, Portal, call Dad.

3
00:00:28,780 --> 00:00:30,960
♪ 当利率降下来 ♪
♪ When the rates fall ♪

4
00:00:30,960 --> 00:00:32,940
♪ 他们会再融资 ♪
♪ They will refi ♪

5
00:00:33,207 --> 00:00:37,873
♪ 那就是房产经纪人的摇篮曲 ♪
♪ And that's the Realtor's lullaby ♪

6
00:00:38,140 --> 00:00:39,260
乔治 拜托
George, please!

7
00:00:39,260 --> 00:00:41,260
他们怎么还在哭啊
Why are they still crying?

8
00:00:41,260 --> 00:00:43,040
是不是因为他们知道自己是小胖子了
Do you think they know they're chubby?

9
00:00:43,660 --> 00:00:44,960
虽然花了不少时间
It took us a while,

10
00:00:44,960 --> 00:00:46,500
但我们终于给孩子取好名字了
but we finally named our babies.

11
00:00:46,500 --> 00:00:47,620
这是"茵素"
This is Poppy,

12
00:00:47,620 --> 00:00:49,020
因为我最喜欢的花就是罂粟花
because that's my favorite flower.

13
00:00:49,020 --> 00:00:50,600
这是乔治
And this is George,

14
00:00:50,600 --> 00:00:52,260
因为他出生时看上去很好奇
because he came out looking curious.

15
00:00:52,260 --> 00:00:54,940
取自歌手博伊·乔治
You know, like Boy George.

16
00:00:55,238 --> 00:00:58,120
传送门 接通吧
Oh, hey, Portal, answer.

17
00:00:58,120 --> 00:00:59,840
嗨 艾丽克斯
Hi, Alex!

18
00:00:59,840 --> 00:01:01,560
我的冰雪女王宝贝怎么样啊
How's my little ice queen?

19
00:01:01,560 --> 00:01:03,160
我上高中时就不喜欢别人叫我冰雪女王
Didn't love being called that in high school,

20
00:01:03,160 --> 00:01:04,176
现在也不喜欢
don't love it now.

21
00:01:04,176 --> 00:01:06,320
你好啊 宝贝 总是有很多人问我
Hey, honey. Um, people keep asking --

22
00:01:06,320 --> 00:01:07,320
能再跟我说说你在做什么吗
tell me again what you're doing?

23
00:01:07,320 --> 00:01:09,980
探测南极大陆地下中微子的存在
Detecting the presence of neutrinos beneath the South Pole.

24
00:01:09,980 --> 00:01:12,260
好吧 打住 我还是继续告诉他们
Yeah, you -- you can stop. I'm just gonna keep telling them

25
00:01:12,260 --> 00:01:13,860
你在搜寻雪怪吧
you're searching for the snow monster.

26
00:01:13,860 --> 00:01:15,680
不是吧 艾丽克斯
Seriously, Alex?

27
00:01:15,680 --> 00:01:17,680
你就不能下楼来跟我们聊吗
You can't come downstairs to talk to us?

28
00:01:17,680 --> 00:01:19,200
我已经离开一个月了
I've been gone for a month.

29
00:01:19,200 --> 00:01:21,080
等等 所以下水道卡着的是我的头发吗
Wait. So, that's my hair in the drain?

30
00:01:22,080 --> 00:01:23,820
宝贝 你那边一切都好吧
Honey, is everything okay?

31
00:01:23,820 --> 00:01:25,280
你看上去有点悲伤
You look a little sad.

32
00:01:25,280 --> 00:01:26,220
不 没有
Oh, no, no.

33
00:01:26,220 --> 00:01:29,120
我是之前有点悲伤 脸被冻住塑形了
I was sad earlier, and my face froze that way.

34
00:01:29,120 --> 00:01:30,543
但我不后悔拒掉
But no regrets about

35
00:01:30,543 --> 00:01:33,380
洛杉矶的科技公司那份轻松的工作
turning down that cushy tech job in L.A.

36
00:01:33,380 --> 00:01:36,340
我是说 没错 我想念比尔了
I mean, yeah, I miss Bill

37
00:01:36,340 --> 00:01:39,980
以及有其他女性同事在周围的安全感
and the safety of other women around,

38
00:01:39,980 --> 00:01:41,280
但外公说得对
but Grandpa was right.

39
00:01:41,280 --> 00:01:43,700
现在正是享受冒险的大好光阴
This is the time of life to have an adventure.

40
00:01:43,700 --> 00:01:45,880
我是不是联系得不是时候
Is this a bad time?

41
00:01:45,880 --> 00:01:48,620
不 不 这已经成为我们的新常态了
Oh, no. No, this is our new normal.

42
00:01:48,620 --> 00:01:50,260
-是啊 -我们就没睡过觉了
- Yeah. - We never sleep.

43
00:01:50,260 --> 00:01:52,880
我太理解被剥夺睡眠的痛苦了
Well, I know all about sleep deprivation.

44
00:01:52,880 --> 00:01:53,902
这里是极昼 太阳永远不落
The sun never sets here,

45
00:01:53,902 --> 00:01:55,488
-所以我已经好几天没睡过觉了 -好吧 真有趣
- so I've been up for days. - Yeah, that's fun.

46
00:01:55,488 --> 00:01:56,259
-真好 宝贝 -我现在醒着都能做梦
- Really nice, honey. - I dream awake now.

47
00:01:56,259 --> 00:01:58,599
稍等下 海莉
Hang on a second. Haley.

48
00:01:58,760 --> 00:02:01,569
海莉 我知道你铁了心坚持母乳喂养
Haley, I know that you are committed to breastfeeding

49
00:02:01,569 --> 00:02:02,985
信奉这本书
and the book,

50
00:02:02,985 --> 00:02:05,522
但我觉得你是时候考虑使用配方奶粉了
but I think it's time that you considered formula.

51
00:02:05,522 --> 00:02:07,460
那将有助于婴儿的睡眠
It will help the babies sleep,

52
00:02:07,460 --> 00:02:09,960
儿童医生也说那是绝对健康的
and the pediatrician said it is perfectly healthy.

53
00:02:09,960 --> 00:02:11,624
我就是活生生的证据 我从小就是喝奶粉长大的
I'm living proof. I was a formula baby --

54
00:02:11,624 --> 00:02:13,520
-6个月时嘴里牙就长满了 -就是啊
- had a full set of teeth at six months. - Yeah.

55
00:02:13,520 --> 00:02:14,728
但是这书上说...
But the book says --

56
00:02:14,728 --> 00:02:16,120
又是这本书
Uch, the book.

57
00:02:16,120 --> 00:02:18,060
你对我的书有什么意见
What do you have against my book?

58
00:02:18,060 --> 00:02:20,660
这本书名叫《你父母的育儿方式全是错的》
It is called "Your Parents Did Everything Wrong."

59
00:02:20,709 --> 00:02:23,791
古迪医生是个享有盛名的小儿生活指导师
Dr. Goode is a celebrated pediatric life coach.

60
00:02:23,840 --> 00:02:25,580
你能调低一点你身上的消极性吗
And can you tone down the negativity?

61
00:02:25,580 --> 00:02:28,400
第六章说这可能会引起对花生的过敏
Chapter six says that it can cause an allergy to peanuts.

62
00:02:28,596 --> 00:02:31,140
天啊 小孩子都应该有史努比的陪伴长大
Oh, man, no kid should grow up without Snoopy.

63
00:02:31,140 --> 00:02:33,220
听上去像是个疯狂的清晨
Sounds like a crazy morning.

64
00:02:33,220 --> 00:02:33,829
我好怀念这种生活
I miss those.

65
00:02:33,829 --> 00:02:35,585
我的研究搭档英格瓦不会说英语
My research partner, Yngvar, doesn't speak English.

66
00:02:35,585 --> 00:02:37,180
是我吗干的
Is me who did that?

67
00:02:37,180 --> 00:02:42,812
除了他从《凡人琐事》的重播集中学到的台词
Except for what he learned from reruns of "Family Matters."

68
00:02:42,812 --> 00:02:44,655
各位
Guys!

69
00:02:44,655 --> 00:02:46,580
有时候那真的有点烦人
So that can be a little annoying

70
00:02:46,580 --> 00:02:48,420
因为你的研究搭档竟然不会说你的语言
having a research partner not speak your language,

71
00:02:48,430 --> 00:02:50,030
不过我可以学他的语言
but I could also try and learn his language,

72
00:02:50,040 --> 00:02:51,360
我也真的去学了
which I have.

73
00:02:51,360 --> 00:02:56,800
敢吵醒他们 我就杀了你
Wake them, and I kill you.

74
00:03:22,200 --> 00:03:23,480
更像西班牙语一些
More Spanish.

75
00:03:24,614 --> 00:03:25,749
如果这是在玩角色扮演
If this is role-playing,

76
00:03:25,749 --> 00:03:28,277
我想扮演"被恶心到的儿子"一角
I'd like to play the part of disgusted son.

77
00:03:28,277 --> 00:03:31,420
我要为我的狗窝公司做个宣传视频
I'm making a promo video for my dog-bed company.

78
00:03:31,420 --> 00:03:33,040
当然了 领衔主演是斯黛拉
And Stella's the star, of course.

79
00:03:33,040 --> 00:03:35,200
今天我们要给它录配音
Today we're recording her voice.

80
00:03:35,200 --> 00:03:37,240
我亲自配西班牙语版本
And I am doing the Spanish version.

81
00:03:37,240 --> 00:03:38,460
导演是谁
Who's directing it?

82
00:03:38,460 --> 00:03:39,680
我不知道 大概是我吧
I don't know. Me, I guess.

83
00:03:39,680 --> 00:03:41,300
这可真让我感到很受伤
Wow, that's a punch in the gut.

84
00:03:41,464 --> 00:03:43,247
怎么了 曼尼 你想来执导吗
Why, Manny? Do you want to direct it?

85
00:03:43,400 --> 00:03:44,080
为什么不行
Why not?

86
00:03:44,080 --> 00:03:46,340
有些最出色的艺术家也是拍广告出身的
Some of our best artists started out making commercials.

87
00:03:46,340 --> 00:03:49,340
我比斯派克·琼斯或吉列尔莫·德尔托罗更出色吗
Am I better than Spike Jonze or Guillermo del Toro?

88
00:03:49,340 --> 00:03:50,500
没有
Nope.

89
00:03:50,500 --> 00:03:53,380
听着 通常我都会编个原因
Listen, normally I would just

90
00:03:53,380 --> 00:03:55,481
说你导不了
cook up some fake reason why you couldn't direct it,

91
00:03:55,481 --> 00:03:57,568
但这个情况下 我有个真正的理由
but in this case, I have a real excuse.

92
00:03:57,800 --> 00:03:59,680
你的前女友雪莉
Your old girlfriend, Sherry,

93
00:03:59,680 --> 00:04:01,000
为斯黛拉配音
is the voice of Stella.

94
00:04:01,720 --> 00:04:03,360
杰 你怎么能这样
Jay, how could you?

95
00:04:03,360 --> 00:04:06,500
雪莉可是在他提出了要娶她的想法后
After she broke his heart when she got repulsed

96
00:04:06,500 --> 00:04:08,380
被吓跑并伤透了他的心呢
by the idea of getting married to him?

97
00:04:08,380 --> 00:04:10,100
更多的是不知所措 不是吓跑吧
More overwhelmed than repulsed,

98
00:04:10,100 --> 00:04:11,020
我记得是这样
as I remember it.

99
00:04:11,020 --> 00:04:12,286
她已经在我们网站上
She's already on our website

100
00:04:12,286 --> 00:04:13,497
为斯黛拉配音了
as Stella's voice.

101
00:04:13,760 --> 00:04:14,860
现在改变
Changing that now

102
00:04:14,860 --> 00:04:16,420
会让我们的粉丝不好接受
could be jarring for our fans.

103
00:04:16,420 --> 00:04:17,036
就比如他们把我的GPS
Like when they made

104
00:04:17,036 --> 00:04:18,720
变成女版英式口音
my GPS lady British.

105
00:04:18,720 --> 00:04:19,922
我情愿迷路
I'd rather be lost

106
00:04:19,922 --> 00:04:22,000
也不要被一个臭屁鬼导航
than talked down to by a snob!

107
00:04:22,000 --> 00:04:22,960
拜托了 杰
Please, Jay.

108
00:04:22,960 --> 00:04:25,120
我需要证明我已经放下她了
I need to prove to myself that I'm over her,

109
00:04:25,120 --> 00:04:27,040
我可以不受其影响 做得很专业
that I can rise above it and be professional.

110
00:04:27,040 --> 00:04:29,300
好吧 但如果你的感情
Fine, but if your emotions

111
00:04:29,300 --> 00:04:30,780
阻碍了这个作品
get in the way of this production,

112
00:04:30,780 --> 00:04:33,820
你就再没有机会为狗窝做广告
you will never work in dog-bed commercials again.

113
00:04:33,820 --> 00:04:34,760
别担心
Don't worry.

114
00:04:34,760 --> 00:04:35,840
我唯一的热情
My only passion

115
00:04:35,840 --> 00:04:37,920
就是帮你实现你充满创造力的想象
is helping you realize your creative vision.

116
00:04:37,920 --> 00:04:42,060
今天结束前 雪莉就会是我的了
By day's end, Sherry will be mine.

117
00:04:44,399 --> 00:04:46,050
不 我们今天庆祝
Oh, no, which icon's birthday

118
00:04:46,050 --> 00:04:47,308
哪个偶像的生日
are we celebrating today?

119
00:04:47,308 --> 00:04:48,340
劳伦·白考尔
Uh, Lauren Bacall's.

120
00:04:48,340 --> 00:04:50,080
等下我们会在她的墓碑前撒郁金香
We're dropping tulips by her grave later,

121
00:04:50,080 --> 00:04:51,215
但这不是为了她的生日
but that's not what this is.

122
00:04:51,215 --> 00:04:53,333
不 我有些迷途青年学生要来
No, I'm having some at-risk students over.

123
00:04:53,333 --> 00:04:54,488
-你们问为什么 -我不想知道
- Why, you ask? - I'm good.

124
00:04:54,488 --> 00:04:56,140
因为我想和这些孩子建立情感
Well, 'cause I want to bond with these kids.

125
00:04:56,140 --> 00:04:57,800
我想让他们知道
I want them to know that even though

126
00:04:57,800 --> 00:04:59,000
即便整个世界放弃了他们
the rest of the world's given up on them,

127
00:04:59,000 --> 00:04:59,580
我也不会
I haven't.

128
00:04:59,580 --> 00:05:02,200
我不想只做他们的副[坏]校长
I don't want to just be their Vice Principal.

129
00:05:02,200 --> 00:05:04,140
我想做他们的好校长
I want to be their nice principal.

130
00:05:04,140 --> 00:05:06,680
我不敢相信你让此发生
I can't believe you let this happen.

131
00:05:06,680 --> 00:05:07,940
我不知道他会玩文字哏
I didn't know there'd be wordplay.

132
00:05:07,940 --> 00:05:10,860
小卡让我作为助理检察官和他的学生聊聊
Cam asked me to speak to his students as an Assistant DA,

133
00:05:10,860 --> 00:05:13,520
用执法机关的角度与他们交流一下
give them the perspective of law enforcement.

134
00:05:13,520 --> 00:05:15,640
事实上我一直在找个机会
Truth is, I have been looking for an opportunity

135
00:05:15,640 --> 00:05:16,980
展示我的新勋章
to show off my new badge.

136
00:05:16,980 --> 00:05:18,554
即使是最硬气的罪犯
Even the most hardened criminals

137
00:05:18,554 --> 00:05:21,236
看到也会发抖
shudder when they get a gander at --

138
00:05:21,236 --> 00:05:22,620
千万别刮伤了
Please don't be scratched!

139
00:05:22,620 --> 00:05:26,100
♪ 我腿上放着班卓琴 ♪
♪ With a banjo on my knee ♪

140
00:05:26,100 --> 00:05:27,920
我不在乎这些孩子们做过什么
I don't care what these kids did.

141
00:05:27,920 --> 00:05:29,333
-这惩罚太惨无人道了 -我知道
- This is cruel. - I know.

142
00:05:29,333 --> 00:05:31,973
一个玩摇滚的副校长
A vice principal that plays rock 'n' roll.

143
00:05:32,200 --> 00:05:34,020
我是不是不太一样 是的
Am I a little different? Yes, I am.

144
00:05:34,020 --> 00:05:36,140
我不像你们生命中其他成年人
I'm not like the other adults in your life

145
00:05:36,140 --> 00:05:37,840
他们等着你们把事情搞糟
that are just waiting for you to mess up

146
00:05:37,840 --> 00:05:39,140
然后对你们指指点点
so they can point the finger at you.

147
00:05:39,140 --> 00:05:41,300
我不想指指点点[指交]小孩
I don't want to finger a bunch of kids.

148
00:05:41,300 --> 00:05:43,120
这不是我欢乐的来源
That's not how I get my jollies.

149
00:05:43,120 --> 00:05:44,140
小卡 小卡
Cam. Cam.

150
00:05:44,140 --> 00:05:45,060
我知道那种感觉
I know what it's like.

151
00:05:45,060 --> 00:05:46,780
我曾经上学时也遇到问题
I had issues in school,

152
00:05:46,780 --> 00:05:48,540
我也被人各种指指点点[指交]
and I was fingered left and right.

153
00:05:48,540 --> 00:05:50,760
让我告诉你们 那感觉很难受
And let me tell you, it did not feel good.

154
00:05:50,888 --> 00:05:52,642
米奇尔 我们是不是应该录下来
Oh, Mitchell, should we be recording this?

155
00:05:52,760 --> 00:05:54,660
是的 不然我说了别人都不信
Oh, yes, no one's gonna believe me.

156
00:05:54,660 --> 00:05:56,260
这需要多久 塔克先生
How long is this gonna take, Mr. Tucker?

157
00:05:56,260 --> 00:05:58,860
塔克先生是你们的酷副校长
Oh, now, Mr. Tucker's the cool vice principal at school.

158
00:05:58,860 --> 00:06:00,194
在我家里
Here at my house

159
00:06:00,194 --> 00:06:01,080
请叫我小卡
call me Cam.

160
00:06:01,080 --> 00:06:02,580
好吗
Okay?

161
00:06:02,580 --> 00:06:04,260
这是米奇尔
And this is Mitchell.

162
00:06:04,260 --> 00:06:06,440
他是一位助理检察官
He's an Assistant District Attorney,

163
00:06:06,440 --> 00:06:07,865
他是我们的特邀发言人
and he is our guest speaker.

164
00:06:07,865 --> 00:06:09,417
他白[人]到像透明的一样
He's so white he's see-through.

165
00:06:09,760 --> 00:06:12,040
谢谢你
Thank you.

166
00:06:12,040 --> 00:06:15,180
我们居住在一个受法律约束的社会
We live in a society bound by laws.

167
00:06:15,180 --> 00:06:15,960
对吧
Okay?

168
00:06:16,135 --> 00:06:19,620
而法律分隔了秩序与混乱
They're all that stand between order and chaos.

169
00:06:19,680 --> 00:06:22,400
而违反法律的人
And those who violate those laws

170
00:06:22,400 --> 00:06:26,000
将会看到法律的这一面...
wind up staring at the business end of --

171
00:06:26,000 --> 00:06:27,720
它不见了
It's gone!

172
00:06:27,720 --> 00:06:29,180
什么 你身上的聚光灯吗
What, the spotlight on you?

173
00:06:29,180 --> 00:06:31,000
不是 我的小丑雕塑
No, my porcelain clown figurine.

174
00:06:31,000 --> 00:06:32,040
它本应该在这个桌子上的
It's supposed to be on this table.

175
00:06:32,040 --> 00:06:34,020
它一直在这个桌子上
It's always on this table.

176
00:06:34,020 --> 00:06:38,700
你们当中有人偷了它
One of you stole it!

177
00:06:39,122 --> 00:06:41,414
居然还在劳伦·白考尔生日这天
And on Lauren Bacall's birthday?

178
00:06:41,414 --> 00:06:42,860
小卡 小卡 冷静
Cam. Cam. R-Relax.

179
00:06:42,860 --> 00:06:45,300
今天不就是为了不要对他们先入为主吗
Uh, isn't the whole point of today not to prejudge them?

180
00:06:45,300 --> 00:06:46,840
得了 米奇尔 他们是垃圾
Oh, please, Mitchell. They're trash.

181
00:06:46,840 --> 00:06:48,680
我知道 他们也知道
I know it. They know it.

182
00:06:48,680 --> 00:06:51,160
每个人都知道
Everybody knows it.

183
00:06:51,160 --> 00:06:54,580
♪ 欢迎回家 我亲爱的宝贝们 ♪
♪ Welcome home, my sweet babies ♪

184
00:06:54,580 --> 00:06:56,780
♪ 交好保证金后 拿钥匙 ♪
♪ After escrow, get the key ♪

185
00:06:56,780 --> 00:06:58,220
求你别唱那首歌好吗
Please don't sing that song.

186
00:06:58,220 --> 00:07:00,440
抱歉 但这首好过《爸爸去房产估价会了》
Sorry, it's better than "Pop Goes the Appraisal."

187
00:07:00,440 --> 00:07:03,220
妈妈 你在干什么
Mom, what are you doing?

188
00:07:03,220 --> 00:07:04,979
快停下 书上说不应该在宝宝午睡时
Stop it. The book says you're not supposed to

189
00:07:04,979 --> 00:07:07,124
跟他们眼神有接触
make eye contact during nap time.

190
00:07:07,124 --> 00:07:10,316
他们只是婴儿 又不是片场的男神约翰尼·德普
They're babies, not Johnny Depp on a film set.

191
00:07:10,492 --> 00:07:13,125
♪ 房屋参观时段为中午到下午5点 ♪
♪ Open house, noon to 5:00 ♪

192
00:07:13,180 --> 00:07:16,280
♪ 这间需要修缮的房子真可爱 ♪
♪ Such a charming fixer-upper ♪

193
00:07:21,679 --> 00:07:23,120
怎么样了
H-o-ow's it going?

194
00:07:23,120 --> 00:07:24,300
还在哭
Still crying.

195
00:07:24,300 --> 00:07:26,640
你没跟他们发生眼神接触吧
You didn't make eye contact, did you?

196
00:07:26,640 --> 00:07:28,880
并没有那种说法 菲尔
That can't be a thing, Phil.

197
00:07:28,880 --> 00:07:30,500
而且我有点听烦了
And I'm getting a little sick

198
00:07:30,500 --> 00:07:32,900
海莉总暗示我们不会抚养小孩
of Haley insinuating that we don't know how to raise kids.

199
00:07:32,900 --> 00:07:34,400
她说的肯定不是我
She can't be saying that about me.

200
00:07:34,400 --> 00:07:37,160
我三十岁期间有五年都拿来跟孩子们盖毯子堡垒
I spent half my 30s in blanket forts with those kids.

201
00:07:37,160 --> 00:07:38,040
知道吗
You know what?

202
00:07:38,040 --> 00:07:40,260
你得去把她哄睡着
You need to get her to go to sleep

203
00:07:40,260 --> 00:07:43,180
我才能用正确的方式把宝宝们哄睡着
so I can put those babies down the right way.

204
00:07:43,180 --> 00:07:44,040
用我们的方式
Our way.

205
00:07:44,040 --> 00:07:46,271
她现在都被逼疯了 我怎么才能哄她去睡觉
She's crazed right now. How am I supposed to get her to sleep?

206
00:07:46,271 --> 00:07:48,293
我不知道啊 她小时候你是怎么做的
I don't know. How did you do it when she was a kid?

207
00:07:53,320 --> 00:07:54,920
爸爸 药店不是在那个方向吗
Dad, isn't the drugstore that way?

208
00:07:54,920 --> 00:07:56,479
是没错 但那边施工
It is, but there's construction,

209
00:07:56,479 --> 00:07:59,152
我只能... 绕个路
so I got to -- got to go around.

210
00:07:59,400 --> 00:08:01,020
车里是不是好热呀
Is it warm in here?

211
00:08:01,020 --> 00:08:02,040
我觉得还好啊
I feel fine.

212
00:08:02,483 --> 00:08:04,615
对了 我最近发现了一个新电台
You know, uh, I just discovered this new station

213
00:08:04,720 --> 00:08:05,900
叫"世界之风"
called "Winds of the World."

214
00:08:06,129 --> 00:08:07,660
这个很棒
Ooh, this is -- this is a good one.

215
00:08:07,900 --> 00:08:08,315
假如你闭上眼睛
If you close your eyes,

216
00:08:08,315 --> 00:08:09,916
就会感觉自己正身处...
it feels like you're right there in, um...

217
00:08:10,360 --> 00:08:11,960
"开阔大草原"
"Open Prairie."

218
00:08:11,960 --> 00:08:12,876
试试 你在后座眯眼休息会儿吧
Try it. You should get some rest back there.

219
00:08:12,876 --> 00:08:13,840
我不困
I'm not sleepy.

220
00:08:13,840 --> 00:08:15,288
你不用睡着啦
Well, you don't have to sleep.

221
00:08:15,288 --> 00:08:18,234
就是闭目养神一下
Just, uh -- Just rest your eyes.

222
00:08:18,234 --> 00:08:20,047
人家不想嘛
Uch. I don't wanna.

223
00:08:20,047 --> 00:08:22,980
你发脾气只是因为你太累了
You are just grumpy 'cause you're overtired.

224
00:08:22,980 --> 00:08:23,825
别再说我累了好不好
Stop saying I'm tired!

225
00:08:23,825 --> 00:08:24,520
好的
Okay.

226
00:08:24,520 --> 00:08:27,400
我知道了
I know.

227
00:08:27,400 --> 00:08:28,700
我们来列举一下
Let's make a list

228
00:08:28,700 --> 00:08:30,340
明天都想做些什么事吧
of all the things we want to do tomorrow.

229
00:08:31,173 --> 00:08:32,879
我嘛 我打算吃华夫饼
I am, uh -- I'm gonna have some waffles,

230
00:08:33,514 --> 00:08:34,244
出门
uh, go outside,

231
00:08:35,276 --> 00:08:37,494
列出我所有朋友的名字
uh, make a list of all my friends' names.

232
00:08:38,157 --> 00:08:40,611
有... 邮差
There's, uh, the mailman...

233
00:08:43,681 --> 00:08:47,168
开... 冰淇淋店的那位女士
the lady with the ice cream...house...

234
00:08:53,497 --> 00:08:55,687
当你躺在斯黛拉的狗床上
Cuando te acuestas en una cama de perro por Stella,

235
00:08:56,122 --> 00:08:58,027
你会感到被爱环抱
sabes que eres amado.

236
00:09:01,580 --> 00:09:06,980
非常棒 老婆 录好了
It's perfect, honey. We got it.

237
00:09:06,980 --> 00:09:08,140
她永远都说不好了
She's never gonna get there.

238
00:09:08,140 --> 00:09:10,000
我去公园里找个拉丁裔保姆来配音好了
I'll ask one of the nannies in the park to do it

239
00:09:10,000 --> 00:09:10,980
就下次我照顾乔的时候
next time I take Joe.

240
00:09:10,980 --> 00:09:11,980
她们爱死我了
They love me.

241
00:09:11,980 --> 00:09:14,420
我每次去她们都非要送我粉蒸肉带走
I can never get out of there without a bag of tamales.

242
00:09:14,420 --> 00:09:15,823
我们的巨星来了
Well, there's our star!

243
00:09:15,823 --> 00:09:19,580
杰你好啊 我超喜欢剧本 好有趣哦
Hey, Jay. Love the script, so fun!

244
00:09:19,580 --> 00:09:20,440
曼尼
Manny.

245
00:09:20,440 --> 00:09:21,980
我不知道你会来
I didn't know you'd be here.

246
00:09:21,980 --> 00:09:23,240
我是你的导演
I'm your director.

247
00:09:23,286 --> 00:09:24,760
我们之间用不着感到尴尬
No reason it has to be awkward.

248
00:09:24,760 --> 00:09:26,080
只要你在"开拍"和"卡"之间
As long as you do everything I say

249
00:09:26,080 --> 00:09:27,360
完全按我说的去做
between "Action" and "Cut."

250
00:09:27,360 --> 00:09:28,340
说到开拍
Speaking of which,

251
00:09:28,340 --> 00:09:29,880
我最近"开啪"了不少次呢
I've been getting quite a bit of action.

252
00:09:29,880 --> 00:09:32,200
卡 听着 这场地按小时收我租金的
And cut. Look, I'm renting this joint by the hour.

253
00:09:32,200 --> 00:09:34,380
我们赶快开工行吗
Can we just do this?

254
00:09:34,380 --> 00:09:35,840
你好 歌洛莉亚
Hi, Gloria.

255
00:09:35,840 --> 00:09:38,080
雪莉你好 演出顺利[摔断腿]
Hi, Sherry. Break your legs.

256
00:09:38,080 --> 00:09:41,020
雪莉 你准备好就随时开始吧
Okay, Sherry, whenever you're ready.

257
00:09:41,020 --> 00:09:45,460
天惹 我在公园玩了一整天的接球 挖地
Boy, am I tired after a day of playing fetch, digging,

258
00:09:45,460 --> 00:09:47,520
和闻其他狗狗之后 真是累毙了耶
and sniffing other dogs at the park.

259
00:09:47,520 --> 00:09:50,780
要是有张美国制造的床就好啦
If only there were an American-made bed...

260
00:09:50,914 --> 00:09:52,771
真抱歉 刚才表现太糟了
Ugh, I'm so sorry. That was terrible.

261
00:09:52,840 --> 00:09:54,320
曼尼 我们重头来过好吗
Manny, can we start over?

262
00:09:54,320 --> 00:09:55,920
我从没有过停止爱...
I never stopped..

263
00:09:56,600 --> 00:09:58,460
你是指广告 好
You mean the commercial. Yes.

264
00:09:58,460 --> 00:10:01,100
不过 你刚才表现得很到位
Although, that was exquisite.

265
00:10:01,988 --> 00:10:03,879
我都相信你真是条狗了
I believed that you're a dog.

266
00:10:03,879 --> 00:10:05,920
我是歌洛莉亚啦
It's Gloria.

267
00:10:05,920 --> 00:10:09,000
而你 真是丢人丢到家了
And you, you're embarrassing yourself.

268
00:10:09,000 --> 00:10:10,920
-你在说什么呢 -你想赢回她的芳心
- What are you talking about? - You're trying to win her back.

269
00:10:11,100 --> 00:10:13,160
纽扣打开了几颗 喷了香水
The unbuttoned shirt, the cologne,

270
00:10:13,340 --> 00:10:16,140
还赞美她刚才那乏味的表演
the praising of her pedestrian performance.

271
00:10:16,140 --> 00:10:18,060
-你不会成功的 曼尼 -为什么
- It's not gonna work, Manny. - Why not?

272
00:10:18,060 --> 00:10:19,840
因为如果你希望别人喜欢你
Because if you want someone to like you,

273
00:10:19,840 --> 00:10:21,880
就得让他们想要得到你的认可才行
you need to make them want your approval.

274
00:10:21,880 --> 00:10:23,780
妈妈 这种老招早就被用过八百遍了
Mom, that's a tired, old way of thinking

275
00:10:23,780 --> 00:10:24,485
不会有用的
that doesn't work.

276
00:10:24,485 --> 00:10:25,280
给你
Here you go.

277
00:10:25,640 --> 00:10:28,340
你觉得这杯东西有什么问题
What do you think is wrong with this?

278
00:10:28,340 --> 00:10:31,020
见鬼 忘记放柠檬了 宝贝抱歉
Damn it, the lemon! I'm sorry, baby.

279
00:10:33,127 --> 00:10:34,700
从头再来一遍
L-Let's start from the top.

280
00:10:34,700 --> 00:10:36,500
这次语速别那么慢
And this time, not so slow.

281
00:10:36,500 --> 00:10:37,360
更强硬点
Stronger.

282
00:10:37,360 --> 00:10:39,191
主张要坚决 曼尼尔
Assert yourself, Manuel.

283
00:10:39,800 --> 00:10:42,120
你说的话我一个字都听不清
And I couldn't understand a word you were saying.

284
00:10:42,120 --> 00:10:44,200
嘴里不要像含着卤蛋
Try to get the marbles out of your mouth.

285
00:10:44,200 --> 00:10:45,280
抱歉
Oh, sorry.

286
00:10:45,280 --> 00:10:48,680
好的 你有要求尽管提
Yeah, whatever you need.

287
00:10:48,680 --> 00:10:51,200
没准真能成
Wow, maybe this could work.

288
00:10:51,200 --> 00:10:54,480
反正你都站着了 我肩膀有点僵
While you're up, my shoulders are a little tight.

289
00:10:54,480 --> 00:10:55,400
帮我揉揉好吗
You mind getting in there?

290
00:10:55,400 --> 00:10:58,060
我的双手接近你的颈动脉你还有命吗
I don't think you want my hands that close to your neck.

291
00:10:58,060 --> 00:11:02,120
我邀请你们到我家来
I invite you into my home,

292
00:11:02,120 --> 00:11:05,460
可你们就这样报答我
and this is how you repay me?

293
00:11:05,460 --> 00:11:06,680
我知道你们是怎么想的
Oh, I know what you were thinking.

294
00:11:06,801 --> 00:11:09,239
"他过着帝王般的生活 不差一个小雕塑"
"He'll never miss it. He lives like a king."

295
00:11:09,360 --> 00:11:11,327
我们没偷你的破小丑
We didn't take your stupid clown!

296
00:11:11,327 --> 00:11:14,120
你怎么知道是小丑 苏西
Interesting you know it's a clown, Suzie!

297
00:11:14,120 --> 00:11:17,400
你都说过三次了 卡梅隆
You said it three times, Cameron.

298
00:11:17,400 --> 00:11:19,060
请叫我副校长塔克
It's Vice Principal Tucker!

299
00:11:19,060 --> 00:11:21,180
放尊重点 我可不是你妈的鸡头
Show some respect. I'm not your mom's pimp.

300
00:11:21,369 --> 00:11:22,979
好了 小卡
Okay, Cam.

301
00:11:23,264 --> 00:11:24,711
小卡 我知道你很喜欢小摆件
Cam, I-I know you like your tchotchkes,

302
00:11:24,900 --> 00:11:27,060
但你叫孩子们来不是为了建立情感吗
but aren't these kids here so you can bond?

303
00:11:27,060 --> 00:11:29,941
艾丽克斯 一切还好吗
Hey, Alex. Everything okay?

304
00:11:29,941 --> 00:11:34,100
是的 或许是我小题大做了
Yeah, yeah. I-I'm probably overreacting.

305
00:11:34,100 --> 00:11:37,440
我之前试着和这的一个科学家交朋友
It's just I tried to make friends with one of the scientists,

306
00:11:37,440 --> 00:11:39,020
但我们语言不通
but there's a language gap.

307
00:11:39,020 --> 00:11:40,990
他误会了 吻了我
He misunderstood and kissed me.

308
00:11:40,990 --> 00:11:43,159
所以现在有点尴尬
So it's a little awkward now.

309
00:11:44,607 --> 00:11:45,680
听起来真有趣
Uh-huh, that sounds fun.

310
00:11:45,680 --> 00:11:47,180
什么 才不是
What?! It's not.

311
00:11:47,180 --> 00:11:49,180
我有点想回家
I kind of want to come home,

312
00:11:49,180 --> 00:11:51,640
可我来这让外公那么激动
but Grandpa was so excited about me doing this,

313
00:11:51,640 --> 00:11:53,960
我不想让他失望
and I don't want to disappoint him.

314
00:11:53,960 --> 00:11:56,620
你总让他失望
Hey, you've disappointed him a lot.

315
00:11:56,620 --> 00:11:57,440
那是种什么体验
What was that like?

316
00:11:57,469 --> 00:11:59,667
艾丽克斯 我为此纠结过许多年
Ohh, Alex, I struggled with this for years,

317
00:11:59,698 --> 00:12:01,116
但我终于悟懂了
but I-I finally learned

318
00:12:01,147 --> 00:12:03,524
最重要的事是
that the most important thing is --

319
00:12:03,555 --> 00:12:05,913
艾丽克斯 替我跟圣诞老人打个招呼
Hey, Alex! Say "Hi" to Santa Claus.

320
00:12:05,943 --> 00:12:08,141
-再见 -这是南极不是北极
- Bye! - I'm at the South Po-

321
00:12:08,291 --> 00:12:10,010
好了 我想好要怎么做了
Okay. Alright, I've decided what I'm gonna do.

322
00:12:10,040 --> 00:12:12,280
我要对其中一个孩子发起猛攻
I'm gonna turn the heat up on one of the kids.

323
00:12:12,280 --> 00:12:14,060
那孩子要是凶手就会承认
If they did it, they'll confess.

324
00:12:14,060 --> 00:12:16,420
假如不是 真凶
If not, the actual criminal...

325
00:12:16,420 --> 00:12:19,060
就会内疚自首
will feel guilty and step forward.

326
00:12:19,325 --> 00:12:21,720
所以咱整个周六就不干别的了吗
So, this is gonna be our whole Saturday?

327
00:12:21,720 --> 00:12:22,445
好吧
Okay.

328
00:12:22,445 --> 00:12:24,174
买单车干嘛 根本没机会骑
Why-Why did we even buy bikes?

329
00:12:24,520 --> 00:12:27,120
是你偷了他的破小丑 对吗
You took his stupid, little clown, didn't you?

330
00:12:27,120 --> 00:12:28,760
你们这代人如此残缺又愤世嫉俗
I find it sad that your generation

331
00:12:28,760 --> 00:12:30,400
太悲哀了
is so damaged and cynical.

332
00:12:30,400 --> 00:12:32,060
那是几天前的事
It happened a few days ago.

333
00:12:32,060 --> 00:12:34,000
我讨厌那玩意
I hated that thing.

334
00:12:34,000 --> 00:12:35,320
必须处理掉
It had to go.

335
00:12:35,320 --> 00:12:39,300
不然他会凑成一整套收藏
I mean, that's how collections start.

336
00:12:39,300 --> 00:12:45,980
我也不喜欢那个猫咪保温罩
I wasn't crazy about the cat cozy, either.

337
00:12:45,980 --> 00:12:47,500
但我从未想过
But I never intended

338
00:12:47,500 --> 00:12:49,940
小卡会错怪那些可怜孩子之一
for Cam to blame it on one of those poor kids.

339
00:12:49,940 --> 00:12:53,312
我本想让保洁阿姨背这个锅的
I mean, I was just gonna pin it on the cleaning lady.

340
00:12:53,312 --> 00:12:54,390
你把它藏哪了 小白崽子
Where's it at, Wonderbread?!

341
00:12:54,390 --> 00:12:55,670
我不知道你在说什么
Uh, I don't know what you're talking about,

342
00:12:55,670 --> 00:12:56,940
塔克老师 我发誓
Mr. Tucker. I-I swear.

343
00:12:56,940 --> 00:12:57,940
好了好了
Okay. Okay.

344
00:12:57,984 --> 00:12:59,775
我们都喘口气
Let's just, uh -- Let's all take a breath

345
00:12:59,820 --> 00:13:02,020
回想一下基本的法律常识 好吗
and just remember some of the basics of the law, okay?

346
00:13:02,020 --> 00:13:03,940
在被证明有罪之前 我们都是无辜的
We're all innocent until proven guilty.

347
00:13:03,940 --> 00:13:06,852
怎么说我也是个身上带着...
Take it from someone who is packing one of --

348
00:13:06,852 --> 00:13:08,840
见鬼 我把警徽忘在厨房了
oh, dang it. Ooh, I left it in the kitchen.

349
00:13:08,840 --> 00:13:10,380
你们先别动
Okay, stay right there.

350
00:13:10,447 --> 00:13:12,340
-太逊了 我们走 -不行
- This is lame. Let's bounce. - Okay, no.

351
00:13:12,340 --> 00:13:15,980
在我找到小雕像前谁也不准走
No one is bouncing until I get my figurine.

352
00:13:15,980 --> 00:13:17,460
但我必须尽快回家
But I have to get home soon.

353
00:13:17,460 --> 00:13:18,500
我读过你的档案 贝琳达
I've read your file, Belinda.

354
00:13:18,500 --> 00:13:22,102
根本没人在乎你 也不在乎你去哪
No one knows or cares where you are.

355
00:13:22,102 --> 00:13:26,025
喝光
And...

356
00:13:26,025 --> 00:13:28,741
搞定
done!

357
00:13:28,741 --> 00:13:31,388
为什么 为什么
Oh, why?! Why?!

358
00:13:31,388 --> 00:13:33,740
这是怎么回事
What is going on?

359
00:13:33,740 --> 00:13:37,480
宝宝们怎么还醒着
How are they still awake?

360
00:13:37,480 --> 00:13:39,660
我吸尘器也开了 奶粉也喂了
I tried the vacuum. I tried formula.

361
00:13:39,660 --> 00:13:40,720
我什么都试过了
I tried everything.

362
00:13:40,720 --> 00:13:41,820
还有办法
Not quite.

363
00:13:41,820 --> 00:13:45,180
是时候拿出
It is time to break out...

364
00:13:45,180 --> 00:13:47,480
大杀器了
the big guns.

365
00:13:47,653 --> 00:13:49,132
我知道海莉不准用安抚奶嘴
I know Haley banned pacifiers,

366
00:13:49,132 --> 00:13:49,860
但我买这些的时候
but I bought these

367
00:13:49,860 --> 00:13:51,800
还以为她会是那种有哏的妈妈
when I thought she was gonna be a fun mom.

368
00:13:51,882 --> 00:13:52,975
来吧
Let's do it.

369
00:13:56,707 --> 00:13:57,605
快看
Look at that.

370
00:13:57,605 --> 00:13:58,972
药到病除
It's working already.

371
00:13:59,114 --> 00:14:01,551
老式育儿胜利了
Old-school parenting for the win.

372
00:14:01,551 --> 00:14:02,636
他们马上就会睡着的
They'll be asleep in no time,

373
00:14:02,636 --> 00:14:03,840
除非看到对方
unless they see each other.

374
00:14:03,840 --> 00:14:06,105
-那就会笑到停不下来了 -是啊
- Then they won't be able to stop laughing. - Yes.

375
00:14:24,173 --> 00:14:25,286
什么情况
What the hell?

376
00:14:25,801 --> 00:14:27,340
奶粉 奶嘴
Formula? Pacifiers?

377
00:14:27,340 --> 00:14:28,460
你们在逗我吗
Are you kidding me?!

378
00:14:28,460 --> 00:14:32,000
这可真是一种清奇的方式来表达"妈妈 谢谢你
This is a very weird way of saying, "Thank you, Mother,

379
00:14:32,000 --> 00:14:33,580
安顿好我的宝宝
for settling down my babies.

380
00:14:33,580 --> 00:14:35,720
我还有很多要向你学习"
I have a lot to learn from you."

381
00:14:35,720 --> 00:14:38,000
我说的你一个字都没听
You ignored everything I asked of you!

382
00:14:38,036 --> 00:14:40,083
海莉 不要对你妈妈这么过分
Haley, don't be so hard on your mom.

383
00:14:40,119 --> 00:14:40,957
还有你
Ohh, you!

384
00:14:40,992 --> 00:14:43,780
这奶嘴一看就是你的风格
Those pacifiers have you written all over them.

385
00:14:48,368 --> 00:14:51,643
宝宝们不该抽烟 反差萌啊
Babies aren't supposed to smoke!

386
00:14:58,760 --> 00:15:01,140
你们怎么能背着我做这种事呢
How could you sneak behind my back like that?

387
00:15:01,140 --> 00:15:02,560
宝贝 我们就是想帮你
Honey, we were just trying to help.

388
00:15:02,560 --> 00:15:03,380
好吧 你没帮上
Well, you didn't.

389
00:15:03,380 --> 00:15:05,860
书里说85%用奶嘴的宝宝
The book says 85% of pacifier users

390
00:15:05,860 --> 00:15:07,220
长大后会变成猫奴
grow up to be cat people.

391
00:15:07,220 --> 00:15:10,280
真不敢相信我会这么说 你真的不能再看书了
I can't believe I'm saying this, but you need to stop reading.

392
00:15:10,280 --> 00:15:11,480
然后呢
And do what?

393
00:15:11,480 --> 00:15:13,460
然后 靠我的母性本能吗
Do what? Rely on my instincts?

394
00:15:13,460 --> 00:15:15,823
我没有本能 这就是问题
I don't have any. That is the problem!

395
00:15:15,823 --> 00:15:17,480
宝贝 每个人都有本能
Honey, everybody has instincts.

396
00:15:17,480 --> 00:15:18,340
是吗 我有吗
Oh, do I?

397
00:15:18,340 --> 00:15:20,160
我一直在等着本能自己发动
Because I keep waiting for them to kick in,

398
00:15:20,160 --> 00:15:20,880
但它没有
and they haven't.

399
00:15:20,880 --> 00:15:22,571
我觉得它永远也不会发动了
And I don't think that they ever will.

400
00:15:22,571 --> 00:15:24,600
我只是 可能我就是不应该成为一个妈妈
I just -- Maybe I'm just not meant to be a mom.

401
00:15:24,600 --> 00:15:26,840
宝贝 你当然可以成为一个妈妈
Sweetie, of course you're meant to be a mom.

402
00:15:26,840 --> 00:15:30,720
听着 感觉到不知所措很正常 真的
Listen, it is normal to feel overwhelmed. Really.

403
00:15:30,720 --> 00:15:32,920
最好的父母都是担心自己做得
It -- The best parents are the ones who worry

404
00:15:32,920 --> 00:15:33,900
不够好的父母
they're doing it wrong.

405
00:15:33,900 --> 00:15:35,060
爱人也一样
Same goes for lovers.

406
00:15:36,363 --> 00:15:37,763
等等 宝宝们还在沙发上吗
Wait, are the babies still on the couch?

407
00:15:38,300 --> 00:15:40,220
他们肯定没事啦
Oh, I'm sure they're fine.

408
00:15:40,333 --> 00:15:42,607
门锁住了 宝宝们这个时候会滚来滚去了
It's locked. Babies start rolling over at this age.

409
00:15:42,607 --> 00:15:43,420
你有钥匙吗
Oh. Do you have a key?

410
00:15:43,420 --> 00:15:46,024
放里面了 不过我很久以前在外面藏了一把
Uh, it's inside, but I hid one out here years ago.

411
00:15:46,024 --> 00:15:46,774
放在
It's in, um...

412
00:15:47,509 --> 00:15:49,031
一块假的石头里
It's in a fake rock.

413
00:15:49,845 --> 00:15:51,182
找不到了
Can't -- Can't find it.

414
00:15:51,182 --> 00:15:52,360
那块石头太真了
It's -- It's too realistic.

415
00:15:52,360 --> 00:15:53,880
我为什么要加钱买逼真的好货
Why did I spring for the good one?

416
00:15:53,880 --> 00:15:55,728
我必须进去
I have to get in there.

417
00:15:55,728 --> 00:15:56,880
海莉 海莉 你要干什么
Haley! Haley, what are you doing?!

418
00:15:56,880 --> 00:15:59,400
宝贝 宝贝 小心
Honey. Honey, be careful.

419
00:15:59,400 --> 00:16:01,980
那个屋顶每爬必摔啊
It's impossible not to fall off of that roof!

420
00:16:04,252 --> 00:16:06,246
茵素 乔治 妈妈来了
Poppy! George! Mommy's coming!

421
00:16:06,400 --> 00:16:09,100
我觉得这看上去很母性本能
Those sure look like mom instincts to me!

422
00:16:09,100 --> 00:16:10,280
你是天生的好妈妈
You're a natural!

423
00:16:10,691 --> 00:16:12,833
现在知道她以前是怎么在宵禁后溜进来的了
Now we know how she used to sneak in after curfew.

424
00:16:13,000 --> 00:16:15,329
也知道今年该让谁来挂圣诞彩灯了
And who's hanging the Christmas lights this year.

425
00:16:15,329 --> 00:16:16,980
-没错了 -宝宝醒了
- Yeah. - Babies are up.

426
00:16:16,980 --> 00:16:18,900
没人去管管吗
Somebody gonna take care of that?

427
00:16:18,900 --> 00:16:23,780
当你躺在斯黛拉的狗床上
When you lie down in a Dog Bed by Stella,

428
00:16:23,780 --> 00:16:25,320
你会感到被爱环抱
you know you're loved.

429
00:16:25,320 --> 00:16:27,320
有好一点吗
Was that any better?

430
00:16:28,260 --> 00:16:30,720
怎么说呢 怎么说呢
Where to begin, where to begin...

431
00:16:30,720 --> 00:16:33,280
你见过狗 对吧
You've met a dog, right?

432
00:16:33,280 --> 00:16:33,740
是啊
Yes.

433
00:16:34,087 --> 00:16:36,132
而且我知道你以前被爱环抱过
And I know you've felt loved before.

434
00:16:36,480 --> 00:16:39,320
那把这两种思路合在一起 这一次尽量做好
So let's link those two ideas and try to get it this time.

435
00:16:39,320 --> 00:16:40,780
我能先喝点水吗
Can I get some water first?

436
00:16:40,780 --> 00:16:41,818
可以吧
I suppose.

437
00:16:41,818 --> 00:16:44,608
你应该让她从狗盆里喝水
You should make her drink it out of a dog bowl.

438
00:16:44,608 --> 00:16:47,000
那有点过分了 但你说得对
That seems over-the-line, but you were right.

439
00:16:47,000 --> 00:16:48,380
这么做确实有用
This is working.

440
00:16:49,962 --> 00:16:52,400
你好 艾丽克斯 我现在有点忙
Hey, Alex. Kinda in the middle of something.

441
00:16:52,400 --> 00:16:54,520
好吧 就是想告诉你这边的事情
Okay. It's just that things are spiraling

442
00:16:54,520 --> 00:16:55,716
有点不受控制
a little bit down here.

443
00:16:55,716 --> 00:16:57,440
这个叫英格瓦的人 一直送我自己杀掉的东西
This guy, Yngvar, keeps trying to woo me

444
00:16:57,440 --> 00:17:00,340
来讨我欢心
with things he's killed.

445
00:17:00,960 --> 00:17:02,221
又一条鱼 谢谢
Another fish. Thanks.

446
00:17:02,221 --> 00:17:03,626
那我把它跟之前的放一起
I'll...put it with the others.

447
00:17:03,626 --> 00:17:06,487
我们怎么还停在这一步 时间不等人
We're still at this? Meter's running.

448
00:17:06,591 --> 00:17:08,420
准备 开始
And...action.

449
00:17:08,420 --> 00:17:11,220
当你躺在斯黛拉的狗床上
When you lie down in a Dog Bed by Stella,

450
00:17:11,220 --> 00:17:13,800
你会感到被爱环抱
you know you're loved.

451
00:17:13,800 --> 00:17:15,200
太棒了
Wow.

452
00:17:15,200 --> 00:17:17,988
把她治到服服帖帖了
You have her right where you want her.

453
00:17:17,988 --> 00:17:21,631
现在过去 给她一点赞美
Now, go in there, give her a little praise,

454
00:17:21,631 --> 00:17:23,880
就能把她钓到你身边
and then reel her in.

455
00:17:23,880 --> 00:17:25,220
这不难
It won't be hard.

456
00:17:25,220 --> 00:17:26,512
这是继有一次即兴表演的观众让她扮
This is her best performance

457
00:17:26,512 --> 00:17:29,691
跟她长得像的名人后 她最好的表演了
since that improv audience suggested "Jackee O."

458
00:17:29,691 --> 00:17:31,210
英格瓦确实人挺好的
Yngvar does seem sweet.

459
00:17:31,340 --> 00:17:33,940
我听说这边的自杀率也开始趋于稳定了
I read the suicide rate here has plateaued.

460
00:17:33,940 --> 00:17:35,620
行了 可以了 结束了 孩子
Okay, that's enough. Wrap it up, kid.

461
00:17:35,620 --> 00:17:36,540
准备回家吧
Time to go home.

462
00:17:36,540 --> 00:17:37,860
太好了 谢谢你
Oh. Thank you.

463
00:17:37,860 --> 00:17:39,538
这边真的不太行
This has not been working out.

464
00:17:39,538 --> 00:17:41,620
我就是需要你的允许才好说出来
I mean, I just needed your permission to admit it

465
00:17:41,620 --> 00:17:43,336
因为我来这里有一部分原因是为了取悦你
because part of me came down here to impress you.

466
00:17:43,336 --> 00:17:45,225
回见啦 外公 爱你
See you soon, Grandpa. Love you.

467
00:17:46,260 --> 00:17:48,280
怎么样
So?

468
00:17:48,280 --> 00:17:49,720
非常棒
That was really good.

469
00:17:49,720 --> 00:17:50,920
真是谢天谢地
Oh, thank God.

470
00:17:50,920 --> 00:17:52,660
这都是你的功劳
I mean, it's all you.

471
00:17:52,660 --> 00:17:55,600
我从来没有遇到过如此老练的导演
I've never had a director with such a sure hand.

472
00:17:55,600 --> 00:17:57,740
太有魔力了
It's so electric.

473
00:17:57,740 --> 00:17:59,880
可不是嘛
It is, isn't it?

474
00:17:59,880 --> 00:18:03,280
有没有兴趣去喝一杯啊 褐眼帅哥
What do you say we get a drink, Brown Eyes?

475
00:18:03,280 --> 00:18:04,760
踏破铁鞋无觅处
It was all happening.

476
00:18:04,760 --> 00:18:07,440
我离导演神作就只差一步了
I was on the brink of a directorial masterpiece.

477
00:18:07,440 --> 00:18:09,320
这种作品可是能够让我一飞冲入
This was the kind of thing that could launch me

478
00:18:09,320 --> 00:18:10,900
无薪实习的机会呢
straight into an unpaid internship.

479
00:18:10,900 --> 00:18:12,954
这杯东西可以再稍等一会
Let's put a pin in that drink.

480
00:18:12,954 --> 00:18:15,349
我想再试一遍
I wanna go again.

481
00:18:16,960 --> 00:18:20,280
虽然只再重录了63次 但我成功了
It took 63 more takes, but I got it.

482
00:18:20,280 --> 00:18:22,680
当你躺在斯黛拉的狗床上
When you lie down in a Dog Bed by Stella,

483
00:18:22,680 --> 00:18:24,180
你会感到被爱环抱
you know you're loved.

484
00:18:24,180 --> 00:18:27,220
你是"纯种"好演员 别表现像个小"杂种"
You're a purebred. Stop acting like a mutt.

485
00:18:27,220 --> 00:18:27,840
再来一次
Again!

486
00:18:27,840 --> 00:18:30,900
当你躺在斯黛拉的狗床上
When you lie down in a Dog Bed by Stella,

487
00:18:30,900 --> 00:18:32,600
你会感到被爱环抱
you know you're loved.

488
00:18:32,600 --> 00:18:34,400
应该还有隐含着痛苦情绪
There's pain behind this.

489
00:18:34,400 --> 00:18:36,140
那些人类不经你同意就把你给绝育了
They spayed you without your permission!

490
00:18:36,140 --> 00:18:39,220
这是你的身体 凭啥别人做决定 再来
It's your body! Who decided?! Again!

491
00:18:39,220 --> 00:18:42,760
当你躺在斯黛拉的狗床上
When you lie down in a Dog Bed by Stella,

492
00:18:42,760 --> 00:18:44,480
你会感到被爱环抱
you know you're loved.

493
00:18:44,480 --> 00:18:47,620
-再来一次 -当你躺在斯黛拉的狗床上
- Again! - When you lie down in a Dog Bed by Stella,

494
00:18:47,620 --> 00:18:49,660
你会感到被爱环抱
you know you're loved.

495
00:18:49,660 --> 00:18:51,746
卡 我们很满意
And cut! We're good in here.

496
00:18:51,746 --> 00:18:53,240
你还有什么想尝试的吗
Anything you wanna try?

497
00:18:53,240 --> 00:18:55,480
"试"也不是跟你试
Not with you!

498
00:18:55,480 --> 00:19:00,500
垃圾 这是我正在看着的东西
Garbage. That's what I'm looking at here.

499
00:19:00,500 --> 00:19:01,880
垃圾人类
Human garbage.

500
00:19:01,880 --> 00:19:03,185
对 你说得对
Yeah, you're right.

501
00:19:03,185 --> 00:19:05,180
就跟我妈说的一样 我就是个渣滓
It's just like my mom says -- I'm nothin'.

502
00:19:05,180 --> 00:19:08,160
我要加入帮派 去弄个脸部刺青
I'm gonna join a gang, get a face tattoo.

503
00:19:08,160 --> 00:19:10,350
我要卖头发去买毒品
I'm gonna sell my hair for nose drugs.

504
00:19:10,350 --> 00:19:12,760
好了好了 停 我听不下去了
No, okay, stop! I-I can't take it anymore.

505
00:19:12,760 --> 00:19:15,440
对不起 是我把雕像丢掉的
I'm sorry. I threw away the statue.

506
00:19:15,440 --> 00:19:18,160
它... 它真的很土嘛
It was -- It was just so tacky.

507
00:19:18,160 --> 00:19:20,840
各位 拜托你们别自暴自弃好吗
You guys, please don't give up on yourselves, okay?

508
00:19:20,840 --> 00:19:22,100
你们还有大好未来在等着你们
You have very bright futures.

509
00:19:22,100 --> 00:19:23,020
是啊 你说得对
Yeah, you're right.

510
00:19:23,020 --> 00:19:24,917
当然有啊 在戏剧界
They sure do... in theater.

511
00:19:24,917 --> 00:19:26,381
因为他们是学校的戏剧俱乐部
Because this is the theater group from school,

512
00:19:26,381 --> 00:19:27,419
引人入胜剧团
The Emotivations!

513
00:19:27,419 --> 00:19:29,280
棒 表现太棒了
Bravo! Brava!

514
00:19:29,280 --> 00:19:33,440
我那天就在垃圾桶里发现了
I found this in the trash the other day.

515
00:19:33,440 --> 00:19:34,918
我知道你肯定不会承认是你丢的
I knew you put it there and wouldn't admit it.

516
00:19:34,918 --> 00:19:38,366
所以我带了一群才华洋溢的悲剧演员回家
So I brought some very talented young thespians over

517
00:19:38,500 --> 00:19:40,820
来演绎迷途青年
to portray at-risk youth.

518
00:19:40,820 --> 00:19:42,500
他抓到你啦 姐妹
He got you, girl!

519
00:19:43,000 --> 00:19:45,080
我说了我想要跟这帮孩子建立情感
You know, I said I wanted to bond with these kids,

520
00:19:45,080 --> 00:19:45,960
绝对是做到了
and I sure did.

521
00:19:46,161 --> 00:19:47,718
这可是十分硬核的"捆绑"
We had some hard-core bondage.

522
00:19:47,920 --> 00:19:50,540
你绝对会被炒鱿鱼
You're gonna get fired.

523
00:19:52,640 --> 00:19:56,190
我疲惫的一身骨头躺在这床上就舒服了
This bed feels good on my weary bones.

524
00:19:56,190 --> 00:19:57,556
等等
Mmm!

525
00:19:57,556 --> 00:19:59,468
有骨头
Bones.

526
00:20:00,076 --> 00:20:02,452
-我需要经费重拍 -做梦吧
- I'm gonna need money for reshoots. - Not gonna happen.

527
00:20:02,452 --> 00:20:05,540
有时候人生中也要知道何时该投降
Sometimes in life, you've got to know when to call it quits.

528
00:20:05,540 --> 00:20:07,440
投降并不总是简单
It's not always easy.

529
00:20:07,440 --> 00:20:10,580
承认自己的错误需要很大的勇气
It takes a lot of courage to admit your mistakes.

530
00:20:10,580 --> 00:20:13,740
你唯一能做的就是尝试从错误中学习
The only thing you can do is try to learn from them

531
00:20:13,740 --> 00:20:16,200
并继续向前迈进
and keep moving forward.

532
00:20:18,520 --> 00:20:20,600
好啦 直升机很快就要到了
Anyways, the helicopter will be here soon.

533
00:20:20,600 --> 00:20:23,580
我想是时候道别了
So, I guess this is goodbye.

534
00:20:29,687 --> 00:20:31,933
我也会想你的
I'll miss you, too.

535
00:20:40,240 --> 00:20:45,540
你听到了吗
Do you hear that?

536
00:20:45,540 --> 00:20:48,973
世上最美妙的声音就是婴儿不哭的声音
There is no sound better than babies not crying.

537
00:20:48,973 --> 00:20:51,318
我们能睡个爽啦
Mm, we're gonna get so much sleep.

538
00:20:51,740 --> 00:20:52,840
又或者...
Or...

539
00:20:52,840 --> 00:20:54,320
又来吗
Again?

540
00:20:54,320 --> 00:20:56,223
我感觉我能表现得更好
I just feel like I could do better.

541
00:20:56,223 --> 00:20:57,740
你表现很可以了
Oh, you were fine.

542
00:20:57,740 --> 00:20:58,200
真的吗
Really?

543
00:20:58,840 --> 00:21:00,401
太好了
Yes!

544
00:21:00,401 --> 00:21:02,540
晚安
Mm. Good night.

545
00:21:02,540 --> 00:21:04,200
晚安
Good night.

546
00:21:04,910 --> 00:21:06,740
什么 那是什么 那是什么
What?! What is that?! What is it?!

547
00:21:06,740 --> 00:21:08,080
海莉 你在干嘛
Haley! What are you doing?!

548
00:21:08,474 --> 00:21:09,554
我又把自己锁门外了
I locked myself out again.

549
00:21:11,974 --> 00:21:13,054
这下好了 "感谢"你们的大吼大叫啊
Great. Thanks for screaming.

550
00:21:15,540 --> 00:21:18,680
要不... 反正我们醒着也是醒着...
Well... as long as we're both awake...
